    "text": "lowndessignal.com\nwebsite\nLowndes County, Alabama\nUnique situations, not funding, challenge wastewater work\nBy Lanell Downs Smith,\n5 hours agoGetting your Trinity Audio player ready... As nonprofit organizations scramble to secure funding, rumors circulate around Lowndes County alleging that Trump Administration funding cuts have left one program without the money needed to continue their work. Inquiries into the claims, however, are proving that the Black Belt Unincorporated Wastewater Program (BBUWP) is operating normally with no intention of slowing down efforts to solve the area’s longtime sewage disposal problem.",
